<Positioned left="100" top="360" height="43.199999999999996"><Text text="凌晨的高速路，只有路灯陪着我。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="36" color="#F1F5F9" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR" fontStyle="BOLD"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="100" top="420" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="但我从不觉得孤独，因为我知道，" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="100" top="460" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="在我休息的驿站里，有一杯热粥等我。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="100" top="520" height="48"><Text text="」" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="40" color="#F59E0B" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR" fontStyle="BOLD"/></Positioned>
